{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17512","headline":"新月与儿女夜坐听琴举酒 · 权德舆","name":"新月与儿女夜坐听琴举酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泥泥露凝叶，骚骚风入林。\n以兹皓月圆，不厌良夜深。\n列坐屏轻箑，放怀弦素琴。\n儿女各冠笄，孙孩遶衣襟。\n乃知大隐趣，宛若沧洲心。\n方结偕老期，岂惮华发侵。\n笑语向兰室，风流传玉音。\n愧君袖中字，价重双南金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}